  "details": "Easy to reproduce. For good measure, I reset my playspace on the Quest dashboard, and reset my horizon adjust. I also restarted my client to make sure everything was properly adjusted before reporting this bug.\n\n1. Log into native Quest client.\n\n2. Have controllers placed down to enter hand-tracking mode.\n\n3. Open the camera; either by double-clicking the camera tab, or by opening the camera menu and enabling it.\n\nYou will see that the camera is out of reach, and the problem will be fixed when you close the camera in the menu and use your controllers to turn the camera mode back on.",
